ith flexible working arrangements.Salary: $99,159 – $106,284 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Coordinate student placements with Reference 310234af-aaad-4187-a68b-a86fa24531ef Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Director, Global Program Liaison Salary Location Parramatta, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Parramatta Business Unit Global Partnerships & Transnational Education (U73N) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Senior Description Full-time, Senior Position on a 5-Year Fixed-Term Contract.Parramatta South campus with flexible working arrangements.Competitive senior-level remuneration, commensurate with experience.Lead the gove Reference 6a621932-48ef-4fb5-b7ef-67af0297c0eb Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Manager, Industry Innovation Salary Location Bankstown, AU Division Research and Innovation (U79) Brand Western Sydney University Location Bankstown Business Unit Deputy Vice-Chancellor, Research & Innovation (U79A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, Fixed-Term position at HEW Level 9 until December 2027.Bankstown City CampusSalary: $139,747 – $149,238 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Lead industry partnerships and the Factor Reference 6eda53c1-cd34-45bb-8c2b-6a215b1472e2 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Officer, Research Infrastructure Partnerships and Operations Salary Location Campbelltown, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Casual Position Category Professional Description Casual, short-term appointment at HEW Level 8, up to 35 hours per week.Campbelltown campus with work at Campbelltown Hospital as required.Casual hourly rate: $82.72 to $91.82, plus Superannuation.Lea Reference 2f8323cb-f421-49d9-8cf1-64bd8804104d Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist 