ry Professional Description Full-time, Fixed-Term position at HEW Level 9 until December 2027.Bankstown City CampusSalary: $139,747 – $149,238 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Lead industry partnerships and the Factor Reference 6eda53c1-cd34-45bb-8c2b-6a215b1472e2 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Officer, Research Infrastructure Partnerships and Operations Salary Location Campbelltown, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Casual Position Category Professional Description Casual, short-term appointment at HEW Level 8, up to 35 hours per week.Campbelltown campus with work at Campbelltown Hospital as required.Casual hourly rate: $82.72 to $91.82, plus Superannuation.Lea Reference 2f8323cb-f421-49d9-8cf1-64bd8804104d Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Strategic Project Coordinator Salary Location Parramatta, AU Division Operations Brand Western Sydney University Location Parramatta Business Unit Data (U76A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, ongoing positionBased at Western’s Parramatta South campusSalary: HEW Level 7 $108,659 – $117,202 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave LoadingShape and implement strategies that strengthen d Reference e7b047f8-911b-4942-9fc6-3642219bbd0b Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Change Analyst, Cyber Salary Location Parramatta, AU Division Vice-Chancellor & President Brand Western Sydney University Location Parramatta Business Unit Strategy & Transformation (U47D) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full time, fixed term position until 12 August 2027Based at Western’s Parramatta South campus, with flexible working arrangementsSalary: HEW Level 7 $108,659 – $117,202 per annum, plus 17% Super and L Reference 8be7fd5c-8b3c-4b8c-8cc7-e5afa74ad1d4 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Sh