ty Vice-Chancellor, Research & Innovation (U79A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, Ongoing position at HEW Level 5.Campbelltown campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $87,065 – $98,462 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Provide technical support, train Reference afd84a12-0c4d-475c-a00c-238accea9bce Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Postdoctoral Research Fellow in Restoring Resilient Groundcover Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit Hawkesbury Institute for the Environment (U73F) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Academic Description Full-time, 3-Year Fixed-Term position at Academic Level A.Hawkesbury Campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $98,611 – $119,137 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Design field and g Reference faad49f2-efd2-4053-960e-3435859aedc8 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Marketing & Communications Business Partner Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Western Sydney & External Engagement Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit Future Students, Marketing and Communications (U77A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full time, ongoing position at HEW level 8Hawkesbury and Campbelltown campus with flexible working arrangementsSalary: $120,754 – $134,051 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading Provide strategi Reference 5fb8628a-daf7-485f-9fcb-d76f09d41c6e Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Associate Professor (Chronic & Complex Care) Salary Location Parramatta, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Parramatta Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Academic Description Full-time, Ongoing position at Academic Level D.Parramatta South campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $182,520 – $200,625 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Lead chronic and comp Reference b912c95b-3fdf-4120-afcd-6bdde66c85e7 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Lecturer Medicine (Oncology) Salary Location Liverpool, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Liverpool Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Part-Time Position Category Academic Description Part-time 14 hours per week (0.4 FTE), Ongoing position.Based at Liverpool Clinical School.Salary: Academic Level C $60,933.20 – $69,991.20 per annum, plus 17% Super & Leave Loading (pro-rata based on Reference b8ce66f7-fdc8-460d-a467-7510d5562025 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Apply"
