    "https://careers.westernsydney.edu.au/job/associate-professor-chronic-and-complex-care-in-parramatta-au-jid-602": {
      "title": "Associate Professor (Chronic & Complex Care)",
      "description": "Associate Professor (Chronic & Complex Care) Division Provost __jobinformationwidget.freetext.LocationText__ Parramatta, AU Contract Type Full-Time Job ID: REF1932W Apply Shortlist Full-time, Ongoing position at Academic Level D. Parramatta South campus with flexible working arrangements. Salary: $182,520 – $200,625 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading. Lead chronic and complex care research, nurse-led clinical trials and nursing education through health service partnerships. The Opportunity You will provide academic leadership in chronic and complex care, building the School’s research capacity and national profile. You will lead investigator-initiated, nurse-led clinical trials and pursue Category 1 research funding as Chief Investigator A. You will deepen collaborative partnerships with health services across the Western Sydney region, drawing on access to THRI and SPHERE to strengthen research translation and multi-site clinical research. You will foster interdisciplinary research teams and networks across the University, health services and the wider nursing profession. You will contribute to teaching and learning within the School’s new curriculum, including subject coordination in the Bachelor of Nursing. Through contemporary blended teaching, course and program development, supervision and mentoring, you will support educational quality across the School’s multi-campus workplace. What Success Looks Like: Build the School’s capacity to undertake chronic and complex care research. Lead funded, multi-site, nursing-led clinical trials and research teams. Secure Category 1 research funding as Chief Investigator A. Strengthen mature and productive partnerships with health services. Contribute to contemporary teaching, curriculum renewal and subject coordination. Please refer to the Position Description for full details. About You A PhD in a relevant discipline and a strong record of research leadership. Current AHPRA registration as a Registered Nurse, with Australian clinical experience. Teaching and research expertise in chronic and complex care. Experience leading funded, multi-site, nursing-led clinical trials. Demonstrated national leadership and experience advancing equity, diversity and inclusion in research and teaching. Benefits We invest in the people who make our mission possible. Alongside a rewarding career, we offer a range of benefits designed to support your financial, personal and family wellbeing. Financial benefits: Access to staff-only products and offers with selected banking partners, salary sacrifice options for onsite parking, and novated motor vehicle leasing. Health and wellbeing support: Free Employee Assistance Program (EAP), complimentary annual flu vaccination, eligibility for Fitness Passport membership, and access to discounted private health cover. Onsite childcare: Long day care and early learning services operate at our Campbelltown, Hawkesbury, Parramatta, and Penrith campuses. Staff may be eligible for discounted fees and salary packaging, with places subject to centre capacity. Application Details Position Enquiries: Direct to Professor Caleb Ferguson, Dean, School of Nursing and Midwifery via C.Ferguson@westernsydney.edu.au. Please include the job reference code REF1932W. Closing Date: 11:59pm, Friday 6 November 2026. Checks: Appointment to this position is subject to a valid Working with Children Check (WWCC) for paid employment in accordance with the Child Protection (Working with Children) Act 2012 (NSW). Working Rights: You must provide evidence of your working rights in Australia at time of application. How to Apply: Please note that only applications submitted via the University’s online recruitment system will be considered. As part of your online application, you will be asked to respond to screening questions addressing the key qualifications, experiences and skills required for this position. Belonging at Western We are committed to substantive equality as outlined in our Equal Opportunity Policy . We actively encourage applications from Indigenous Australians, candidates of all gender identities and expressions, people of all abilities, and those from culturally and linguistically diverse backgrounds. For reasonable adjustments during the application process, please contact talentacquisitionteam@westernsydney.edu.au . About Western This is your opportunity to be part of something bigger. By joining Western Sydney University, you become a valued member of our community. As our region changes, so too does our university. Western is boldly different, energetic, global, diverse, dynamic, and youthful. Our mission is to deliver student success, impactful research, and stronger communities. As part of our team, you will have a stake in shaping the future of education, broadening horizons, and changing lives. Making a difference starts at Western. For the latest please visit our website and LinkedIn . Apply Shortlist Share ABOUT WESTERN Western Sydney University was established in 1989, bringing together a number of existing higher education institutions across the region to create a single, unified university for Western Sydney. Founded with a strong commitment to accessibility and community engagement, the University was designed to expand educational opportunities for one of Australia’s most diverse and rapidly growing regions. Over the years, it has evolved into a world-class institution known for its innovation, research excellence, and focus on equity and social justice—continuing to play a vital role in shaping the future of Greater Western Sydney and beyond. List #1 Some roles you might be interested in Head of Indigenous Future Students Engagement Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Western Sydney & External Engagement Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit Future Students, Marketing and Communications (U77A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, ongoing position at HEW Level 9.Hawkesbury campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $139,747 – $149,238 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading. This is an identified position Reference 7c5bc823-586d-469d-ba01-f2d83b8712f3 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Workforce Reporting Analyst Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Operations Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit People and Culture (U76E) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, Ongoing position at HEW Level 7.Hawkesbury campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $108,659 – $117,202 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Turn complex workforce data into Reference 50d75530-607d-459c-b411-013e1c3ca41c Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Head of Future Students Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Western Sydney & External Engagement Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit Future Students, Marketing and Communications (U77A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, ongoing position at HYEW Level 9.Hawkesbury campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $139,747 – $149,238 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading. Lead domestic student recruit Reference 2cacbbca-4e61-4fbb-b2fe-b91262703be7 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Paid Media Manager Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Western Sydney & External Engagement Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit Future Students, Marketing and Communications (U77A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, ongoing position at HEW Level 8.Hawkesbury campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $120,754 – $134,051 p.a., plus 17% Super and Leave Loading. Lead paid media strategy and perfor Reference b4628282-91c8-4cb8-8eba-40038b154ab1 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Technical Support Officer, Anatomy Salary Location Campbelltown, AU Division Education & Students Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Teaching & Research Technical Services (U75D) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, Ongoing positionBased at Western’s Campbelltown campus, with flexible working arrangementsSalary: HEW Level 6 $99,159 – $106,284 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave LoadingCurrent Hepatitis Reference e76c05b0-8060-4ad0-84e5-d1b1b270987f Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Technical Officer, Mass Spectrometry Salary Location Campbelltown, AU Division Research and Innovation (U79) Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Deputy Vice-Chancellor, Research & Innovation (U79A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, Ongoing position at HEW Level 5.Campbelltown campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $87,065 – $98,462 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Provide technical support, train Reference afd84a12-0c4d-475c-a00c-238accea9bce Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Postdoctoral Research Fellow in Restoring Resilient Groundcover Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit Hawkesbury Institute for the Environment (U73F) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Academic Description Full-time, 3-Year Fixed-Term position at Academic Level A.Hawkesbury Campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $98,611 – $119,137 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Design field and g Reference faad49f2-efd2-4053-960e-3435859aedc8 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Lecturer Medicine Salary Location Liverpool, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Liverpool Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Part-Time Position Category Academic Description Part-time 7 hours per week (0.2 FTE ), Ongoing position.Based at Liverpool Clinical School.Salary: Academic Level C $30,466.60 – $34,995.60 per annum, plus 17% Super & Leave Loading (pro-rata based on Reference bee2150c-a589-4cc7-b609-b255416829bf Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Marketing & Communications Business Partner Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Western Sydney & External Engagement Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit Future Students, Marketing and Communications (U77A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full time, ongoing position at HEW level 8Hawkesbury and Campbelltown campus with flexible working arrangementsSalary: $120,754 – $134,051 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading Provide strategi Reference 5fb8628a-daf7-485f-9fcb-d76f09d41c6e Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Lecturer Medicine (Oncology) Salary Location Liverpool, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Liverpool Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Part-Time Position Category Academic Description Part-time 14 hours per week (0.4 FTE), Ongoing position.Based at Liverpool Clinical School.Salary: Academic Level C $60,933.20 – $69,991.20 per annum, plus 17% Super & Leave Loading (pro-rata based on Reference b8ce66f7-fdc8-460d-a467-7510d5562025 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Apply"
