n Liverpool Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Part-Time Position Category Academic Description Part-time 7 hours per week (0.2 FTE ), Ongoing position.Based at Liverpool Clinical School.Salary: Academic Level C $30,466.60 – $34,995.60 per annum, plus 17% Super & Leave Loading (pro-rata based on Reference bee2150c-a589-4cc7-b609-b255416829bf Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Marketing & Communications Business Partner Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Western Sydney & External Engagement Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit Future Students, Marketing and Communications (U77A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full time, ongoing position at HEW level 8Hawkesbury and Campbelltown campus with flexible working arrangementsSalary: $120,754 – $134,051 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading Provide strategi Reference 5fb8628a-daf7-485f-9fcb-d76f09d41c6e Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Apply"
